Sarana vows to name life-risking chiefs for Rama --- Sarana names Hara trailing sun-ray tails with tree-lifters --- Sarana names bear lord Dhumra and brother Jambavan --- Sarana praises Jambavan Indra aider hurling fearless rocks --- Sarana names Rambha Samnadana grandsire who faced Indra --- Sarana names unboastful Krathana dwelling pleasure hill --- Sarana names Pramathi leading Haimavati host and golangulas --- Sarana names Gavaksha surrounding swift apes for crushing --- Sarana names Kesari Shatabali amid golden hills with myriads --- Sarana names Gaja Gavaya Nala Nila and countless Vindhya hosts
